Engineering Thermodynamics — Olivier Cleynen (@th-cleynen: 0, is #reference, #part-of @th-sources) { r_38CM7HKS0GSN5T09YDXFKHRVGQ
Olivier Cleynen. Engineering Thermodynamics, international edition with SI units, 2025. [Author's book and chapter guide](https://thermodynamicsbook.com/) · [Complete PDF](https://thermodynamicsbook.com/thermodynamics-free-textbook.pdf) · [French original](https://thermodynamique.fr/).

Study the entire ten-chapter book, including solved examples, independent problem attempts and appendices. It develops closed/open energy accounts, gas and liquid/vapour properties, thermal machines, the second law and entropy, then steam and air-based power cycles. Compare its conventions with the chemical text before combining calculations.

The author identifies the first English edition as June 2025, translated from the third French edition, and reports content updated 7 June 2026. The current landing page lists 330 pages; earlier copies/catalogues may differ. CC BY-SA 4.0 applies with component attributions. The author PDF, illustrations, solutions and tables remain external references.

**Return:** [Thermodynamics and heat transfer sources](../Sources.lingua#r_4N96T70VYW3C3M91M2SXF5KEQF).
